            %h6#proposition_4 Proposition
            %p
              Every group 2-cocycle
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi c
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace"} :
                    %mi G
                    %mo ×
                    %mi G
                    %mo →
                    %mi A
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} c \colon G \times G \to A
              is cohomologous to a normalized one, def.
              = succeed "." do
